#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:5 db3cfae45e8e4886bf04370deb8bd4c4
msgid "Using SITL with X-Plane 10/11"
msgstr "将 SITL（软件在环仿真）与 X-Plane 10/11 结合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:10 0694d02399934ec7a488f403e467fcc7
msgid ""
"This article describes how to use X-Plane 10 as a simulation backend for "
"ArduPilot :ref:`SITL <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>`."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何将 X-Plane 10 用作 ArduPilot :ref:`SITL <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-"
"loop>` 的仿真后端。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:17 5406be87dbcf47ad89df45dcae679d32
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:19 69d1521190274fdfac30628349dd9d4c
msgid ""
"X-Plane 10/11 is a commercial flight simulator with a rich networking "
"interface that allows it to be interfaced to other software. In this case we"
" will be interfacing it to the ArduPilot SITL system, allowing ArduPilot to "
"fly a wide variety of aircraft."
msgstr ""
"X-Plane 10/11 是一款商业飞行仿真器，具有丰富的网络接口，可与其他软件对接。本文将其与 ArduPilot SITL 系统对接，使 "
"ArduPilot 能够飞行各种类型的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:24 04dce3fa49314c1ebb2bcd4d79b4c478
msgid ""
"Using X-Plane with SITL is a good way to get some experience flying "
"ArduPilot and learning how to use the ground control station. It can also be"
" used to see how ArduPilot handles unusual aircraft and to develop support "
"for aircraft features that may not be available in other simulator backends."
msgstr ""
"将 X-Plane 与 SITL（软件在环仿真）结合使用，是积累 ArduPilot 飞行经验并学习地面控制站操作的好方法。它还可用于观察 "
"ArduPilot 如何处理非常规飞行器，以及开发其他仿真器后端可能不支持的飞行器功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:30 e4d2fffc0c7c4e3ca983edb1c910df64
msgid ""
"Before starting SITL the only thing you need to setup on X-Plane is the "
"network data to send the sensor data to the IP address of the computer that "
"will run ArduPilot. This can be the same computer that is running X-Plane "
"(in which case you should use an IP address of 127.0.0.1) or it can be "
"another computer on your network."
msgstr ""
"在启动 SITL 之前，您在 X-Plane 中唯一需要设置的是网络数据，以将传感器数据发送到运行 ArduPilot 的计算机 IP "
"地址。该计算机可以是运行 X-Plane 的同一台计算机（此时应使用 IP 地址 127.0.0.1），也可以是网络上的另一台计算机。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:37 3e883d8e841241e7a786acfc9db80855
msgid "Setup of X-Plane 11"
msgstr "X-Plane 11 的设置"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:39 0bd3a3ec101c4f02bc9d5a01355e10e6
msgid ""
"Go to *Settings* -> *Data Output* menu in X-Plane 11 and activate the "
"*General Data Output* tab. Check the *Network via UDP* column for at least "
"one of the settings that ArduPilot will use (e.g. *Times* in the second "
"row). The other will be set with commands over network by ArduPilot itself, "
"note that you can use that to verify a two-way connection."
msgstr ""
"在 X-Plane 11 中进入 *Settings*（设置）-> *Data Output*（数据输出）菜单，激活 *General Data "
"Output*（通用数据输出）选项卡。在 ArduPilot 将使用的至少一项设置中勾选 *Network via UDP*（通过 UDP "
"网络）列（例如第二行的 *Times*）。其余项目将由 ArduPilot 本身通过网络命令设置，您可以通过此方式验证双向连接是否正常。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:43 c6006db4561f43eca727f6425ef502f4
msgid ""
"In the right part of the interface, set *UDP Rate* to 50.0 and make sure "
"that the checkbox below labeled *Send network data output* is set. Set the "
"*IP Address* field to the address of the computer running SITL. Set *Port* "
"field to 49001."
msgstr ""
"在界面右侧，将 *UDP Rate*（UDP 速率）设置为 50.0，并确保勾选下方标有 *Send network data "
"output*（发送网络数据输出）的复选框。将 *IP Address*（IP 地址）字段设置为运行 SITL 的计算机地址。将 "
"*Port*（端口）字段设置为 49001。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:53 1ea83ff716f74e3694cac52275168346
msgid "Setup of X-Plane 10"
msgstr "X-Plane 10 的设置"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:55 182a4799ecc547ccbc5bf169c31dcb70
msgid ""
"Go to the Settings -> Net Connections menu in X-Plane and then to the Data "
"tab. Set the right IP address, and set the destination port number as 49001."
" Make sure that the receive port is 49000 (the default). If using loopback "
"(ie. 127.0.0.1) then you also need to make sure the \"port that we send "
"from\" is not 49001. In the example below 49002 is used."
msgstr ""
"在 X-Plane 中进入 Settings -> Net Connections 菜单，然后切换到 Data 选项卡。设置正确的 IP "
"地址，并将目标端口号设置为 49001。确保接收端口为 49000（默认值）。如果使用回环地址（即 "
"127.0.0.1），还需确保「我们发送数据的端口」不是 49001。下例中使用 49002。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:65 38925072bae745ff8c40c1867479c9c3
msgid ""
"You will also need to output data from X-Plane. Click on *Settings*, then "
"*Data Input & Output*. Copy at least 1 setting from the screenshot below. "
"ArduPilot will then send commands to X-Plane that will enable all of the "
"output data fields that it needs to operate."
msgstr ""
"您还需要从 X-Plane 输出数据。点击 *Settings*（设置），然后点击 *Data Input & "
"Output*（数据输入与输出）。从下方截图中至少复制 1 项设置。ArduPilot 随后会向 X-Plane "
"发送命令，启用其运行所需的全部输出数据字段。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:70 45955185742d42f1bc79be9c7f2da5f1
msgid ""
"If you have a joystick then you can configure the joystick for X-Plane. A "
"joystick controlled by X-Plane will be available as R/C input when ArduPilot"
" is in control of X-Plane, allowing you to fly the aircraft with the "
"joystick in ArduPilot flight modes."
msgstr ""
"如果您有摇杆，可以为 X-Plane 配置摇杆。当 ArduPilot 控制 X-Plane 时，由 X-Plane 控制的摇杆可作为遥控输入，让您在 "
"ArduPilot 飞行模式下使用摇杆操控飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:75 b1f84bba49c7411d8656ac34719d6064
msgid ""
"For joystick setup go to Settings -> Joystick and Equipment. You should "
"setup controls for roll, pitch, yaw and throttle. Note that X-Plane has an "
"unusual throttle setup where the bar is fully to the left at full throttle "
"and fully to the right at zero throttle."
msgstr ""
"要设置摇杆，请进入 Settings -> Joystick and "
"Equipment（摇杆与设备）。您应为滚转、俯仰、偏航和油门设置控制。请注意，X-Plane "
"的油门设置比较特殊：滑块完全向左为满油门，完全向右为零油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:83 e67fa15bbf564e9ba42aaaf3a0b3dae5
msgid ""
"Right now you can't use the joystick for other than basic axes controls, so "
"you can't use it for flight mode changes. We may be able to add support for "
"that in the future."
msgstr "目前摇杆只能用于基本轴控制，无法用于切换飞行模式。未来我们可能会添加相关支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:88 06432ed08c5643058d0d9d92340cca3d
msgid "Starting SITL"
msgstr "启动 SITL（软件在环仿真）"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:90 2dff75a49c1b41759e9d40deb6024d76
msgid ""
"There are three approaches to starting SITL with X-Plane depending on what "
"you are wanting to do."
msgstr "根据您的需求，有三种方法可以启动 SITL 与 X-Plane 的联合仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:93 2beedd2638c04cf2838a04244828986e
msgid "running SITL from within MissionPlanner on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上从 MissionPlanner 内部运行 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:94 2bda4a7e8dbc4261add64a53fc9d974d
msgid "building SITL yourself and connecting from your favourite GCS"
msgstr "自行构建 SITL 并从您喜欢的地面控制站连接"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:95 9ef2a27fbdc742c88c0742f707b8a99b
msgid "building and running SITL using sim_vehicle.py and MAVProxy"
msgstr "使用 sim_vehicle.py 和 MAVProxy 构建并运行 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:97 25fc1aeed8164a56a2c74312ffa9351b
msgid ""
"The first approach is good if you just want to test ArduPilot with SITL but "
"you don't want to make changes to the code. MissionPlanner will download a "
"build of ArduPilot SITL for Windows that is either the current stable "
"release version or a nightly build of the latest ArduPilot code that is "
"under development."
msgstr ""
"如果您只想测试 ArduPilot 与 SITL，而不需要修改代码，第一种方法最为适合。MissionPlanner 将下载适用于 Windows 的 "
"ArduPilot SITL 构建版本，可选当前稳定发布版本或最新开发中 ArduPilot 代码的每夜构建版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:101 ef9ffdb6453f4defb9439bd0c612cb5d
msgid ""
"The second approach is good if you want to do ArduPilot development and try "
"out code changes and you want to use a ground station of your choice. Any "
"ground station that supports MAVLink over TCP can be used."
msgstr ""
"如果您希望进行 ArduPilot 开发、尝试代码更改，并使用自选的地面站，第二种方法最为适合。任何支持通过 TCP 传输 MAVLink "
"的地面站均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:105 0327c7ca64314a13be77bfd1d4d3dba9
msgid ""
"The third approach is good if you want the full capabilities of MAVProxy for"
" ArduPilot SITL testing. MAVProxy has a rich graphing and control capability"
" that is ideal for long term ArduPilot software development."
msgstr ""
"如果您希望充分利用 MAVProxy 的全部功能进行 ArduPilot SITL 测试，第三种方法最为适合。MAVProxy "
"拥有丰富的图形绘制和控制功能，非常适合 ArduPilot 软件的长期开发工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:111 e4bc226a64584964baa908848f7bbdca
msgid "Using SITL from MissionPlanner"
msgstr "从 MissionPlanner 使用 SITL（软件在环仿真）"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:113 30b9ccb195474c9b86340f5561ccde45
msgid "To start SITL directly from MissionPlanner go to the Simulation tab:"
msgstr "要直接从 MissionPlanner 启动 SITL，请进入 Simulation（仿真）选项卡："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:118 59a312a02e624c53ada26f3db065b535
msgid ""
"In the Simulation screen you need to select Model \"xplane\" and then select"
" \"Plane\". At the moment we only support fixed wing and helicopter aircraft"
" in X-Plane with SITL. In the future we may support other aircraft types. "
"See below for more information on flying a helicopter."
msgstr ""
"在 Simulation（仿真）界面，需要选择型号 「xplane」，然后选择 「Plane」（固定翼）。目前，我们仅支持在 X-Plane SITL "
"中飞行固定翼和直升机。未来可能会支持其他飞行器类型。有关直升机飞行的更多信息，请参见下文。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:123 46d0691270bc47a783f773b719072d97
msgid ""
"When you select \"Plane\" MissionPlanner will present a selection for "
"downloading the current stable release or a nightly build of ArduPilot."
msgstr "选择 「Plane」（固定翼）后，MissionPlanner 将提供下载当前稳定发布版或 ArduPilot 每夜构建版的选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:128 507fb1ea00a54a62a3704f2b5acd4918
msgid ""
"You then need to load an appropriate set of parameters for the aircraft (or "
"setup the aircraft just like you would a real aircraft) and enjoy flying as "
"usual with MissionPlanner."
msgstr "然后，您需要为飞行器加载合适的参数集（或像配置真实飞行器一样进行设置），即可像平常一样通过 MissionPlanner 享受飞行乐趣。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:132 1335ff2b0d3d409d90aa96dcbf84af05
msgid ""
"When setting up the aircraft it is useful to use the joystick to move the "
"control surfaces to make sure they are all going the right way. You can "
"change channel direction in the normal way with ArduPilot parameters."
msgstr "设置飞行器时，建议使用摇杆移动各控制面，确认其方向均正确。您可以通过 ArduPilot 参数以常规方式更改通道方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:139 390a3c64d6344a1c9613d1c888d715e3
msgid "Using SITL with your own GCS"
msgstr "使用 SITL（软件在环仿真）配合您自己的地面控制站"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:141 21b657ca356c43b88a9b8869bc7cdd6b
msgid ""
"The second approach to running X-Plane 10/11 with SITL is to build ArduPilot"
" SITL manually and then run it from the cygwin command line. You can then "
"connect with your favourite GCS."
msgstr ""
"将 X-Plane 10/11 与 SITL 结合运行的第二种方法是手动构建 ArduPilot SITL，然后从 cygwin "
"命令行运行。之后您可以使用自己喜欢的地面控制站进行连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:145 19f303780f9c4249b65c4c2f60b2af09
msgid ""
"You should checkout the latest ArduPilot git tree in cygwin, and then change"
" directory to the top \"ardupilot\" directory. Then run the following "
"commands::"
msgstr "请在 cygwin 中检出最新的 ArduPilot git 代码树，然后切换到顶层 「ardupilot」 目录。之后运行以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:156 aadf50da4c534dad8f49af3dc4c9d8b3
msgid ""
"That will start SITL and wait for a GCS to connect. You should connect on "
"TCP port 5760 and configure ArduPilot as usual."
msgstr "这将启动 SITL 并等待地面控制站连接。请通过 TCP 端口 5760 进行连接，并像往常一样配置 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:160 ed501b18e26243038fab41cc38dc722b
msgid "Using SITL with sim_vehicle.py"
msgstr "使用 sim_vehicle.py 运行 SITL（软件在环仿真）"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:162 14efbb2a8074466f95be26294c5bbd37
msgid ""
"The sim_vehicle.py script gives you a lot of options for launching all of "
"the different simulation systems that work with ArduPilot, including "
"X-Plane."
msgstr "sim_vehicle.py 脚本提供了多种选项，用于启动与 ArduPilot 配合使用的各类仿真系统，包括 X-Plane。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:166 e9a9a972826347b78fc5cf928cdb193d
msgid ""
"To use sim_vehicle.py you will need to install MAVProxy. If you are on Linux"
" then make sure pip is installed and run::"
msgstr "要使用 sim_vehicle.py，您需要安装 MAVProxy。如果您使用 Linux，请确保已安装 pip，然后运行："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:171 9a6cdc9a7e9d4b648a46237452a5f2b5
msgid ""
"If you are on Windows then download and install MAVProxy from "
"https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVProxy/"
msgstr ""
"如果您使用 Windows，请从 https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVProxy/ 下载并安装 "
"MAVProxy。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:174 0c02344cbcab4c349f4e026534339611
msgid ""
"Then do a git checkout of ArduPilot master and change directory to the "
"ArduPlane directory. I like to create a sub-directory for each aircraft I "
"fly in SITL so that settings are remembered per-aircraft. If you want to do "
"that then create a subdirectory in the ArduPlane directory and run "
"sim_vehicle.py from there. In the following example I will be using the PT60"
" aircraft in X-Plane, so I create a PT60 directory::"
msgstr ""
"然后检出 ArduPilot master 分支，并切换到 ArduPlane 目录。建议为每架在 SITL "
"中飞行的飞行器创建一个子目录，以便分别记住各自的设置。如需这样做，请在 ArduPlane 目录中创建子目录，并从该目录运行 "
"sim_vehicle.py。以下示例使用 X-Plane 中的 PT60 飞行器，因此创建一个 PT60 目录："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:188 a21ac8bb95e4475399916bcfe7e61c6c
msgid "Using SITL running inside WSL2"
msgstr "在 WSL2 内运行 SITL（软件在环仿真）"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:190 88e354bed5c94c0a8e78bb7befd20d3c
msgid ""
"The :ref:`currently recommended<dev:sitl-native-on-windows>` way of setting "
"up SITL for Windows runs in Windows Subsystem for Linux, as explained in "
":ref:`building-setup-windows10_new` for Windows 10 systems or "
":ref:`building-setup-windows11` for Windows 11 systems."
msgstr ""
":ref:`当前推荐 <dev:sitl-native-on-windows>` 的 Windows SITL 设置方式在 Windows "
"Subsystem for Linux 中运行，详见 Windows 10 系统的 :ref:`building-setup-"
"windows10_new` 或 Windows 11 系统的 :ref:`building-setup-windows11`。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:192 b54a7609a8be4385b49c596736f6f1d1
msgid ""
"To connect X-Plane and SITL in this environment you need to manually point "
"each of them at the right address in the virtual network created between the"
" two operating systems."
msgstr "要在此环境中连接 X-Plane 和 SITL，需要手动将它们各自指向两个操作系统之间虚拟网络中的正确地址。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:194 9e5118e4e61943aa8a151ed4716f79e0
msgid ""
"Find the address of Windows reachable from WSL by running ``ipconfig.exe`` "
"in PowerShell or Command Prompt, and looking for the following device::"
msgstr ""
"在 PowerShell 或命令提示符中运行 ``ipconfig.exe``，查找以下设备，获取从 WSL 可访问的 Windows 地址："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:203 509a218236b3444bbc162ecdc9e35de6
msgid ""
"This is the address that you need to pass to the SITL instance running in "
"WSL. In this example it would look like the following::"
msgstr "这就是需要传递给运行在 WSL 中的 SITL 实例的地址。在本例中，命令如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:208 5392280e3fe74c0db50576bc82f4f91e
msgid ""
"On the side of Linux, you can get the address with ``ip addr`` command, look"
" for the address from the same subnet, i.e. with same prefix, as the one you"
" found for Windows. For example, the relevant block looks like this in "
"Ubuntu 20.04::"
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 侧，可以使用 ``ip addr`` 命令获取地址，查找与 Windows 侧地址同一子网（即相同前缀）的地址。例如，在 Ubuntu "
"20.04 中，相关输出块如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:216 a68b1fafde9c4f76ba17323ce206c48e
msgid ""
"Set this address (172.25.67.144 in this example) in the *IP Address* field "
"shown in section `Setup of X-Plane 11`_ above"
msgstr ""
"将此地址（本例中为 172.25.67.144）填入上文 `Setup of X-Plane 11`_ 章节所示的 *IP Address*（IP "
"地址）字段中。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:219 f17c0b82c8c24edd96715b2bc98a7a30
msgid "Flying a Helicopter"
msgstr "飞行直升机"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:221 d0cea2d66b4c436ebcf7ff9ff727ee64
msgid ""
"It is also possible to fly a helicopter with XPlane-10/11. The setup is "
"similar to a plane, with two additional requirements:"
msgstr "也可以在 X-Plane 10/11 中飞行直升机。设置与固定翼类似，但有两项额外要求："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:224 2cc3e1cf81f24a5ba1f3ac90cf90e141
msgid ""
"you need to setup your XPlane joystick to map the collective stick to flaps"
msgstr "需要将 X-Plane 摇杆中的总距杆映射到襟翼"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:226 c28bb581b10c4adb8941250bfc8c4e51
msgid ""
"you need to map a key or joystick button to turn on and off the "
"\"generator1\" electrical system"
msgstr "需要将某个按键或摇杆按钮映射到 「generator1」 电气系统的开关"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:229 81b28773bcb04091b3fd61fe8e77e219
msgid ""
"These strange requirements are because of limitations in the remote control "
"of helicopters in X-Plane 10. The flaps input is something that ArduPilot "
"SITL is able to read remotely while not interfering with flight of the "
"helicopter. The \"generator1 on/off\" is used to simulate the interlock "
"switch (channel 8) in ArduPilot helicopter support."
msgstr ""
"这些特殊要求是由于 X-Plane 10 远程控制直升机存在局限性。襟翼输入可被 ArduPilot SITL "
"远程读取，同时不干扰直升机的飞行。「generator1 on/off」 用于模拟 ArduPilot 直升机支持中的联锁开关（通道 8）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:236 05a991ddcca9435d8bab405faf98b736
msgid ""
"Note that for \"generator on/off\" you do need to map two separate events, "
"one for on and one for off. If using a two position switch then map one to "
"the switch on position and the other to the switch off position."
msgstr ""
"请注意，「generator on/off」 "
"需要映射两个独立事件，一个对应开，一个对应关。如果使用两段式拨动开关，则将一个映射到开位置，另一个映射到关位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:241 48e09251c4c544358721035958ad4fc2
msgid "See this example for typical joystick setup"
msgstr "请参阅此示例了解典型的摇杆设置"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:246 d1b9d4e169f444d6a95468faa68e05cc
msgid ""
"and this one for mapping the generator on/off switch to a joystick switch"
msgstr "以及此示例了解如何将 generator 开关映射到摇杆拨动开关"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:252 379d7c03993e4971ae5968bd61902417
msgid ""
"A full set of parameters for the Bell JetRanger Helicopter in X-Plane 10/11 "
"are available here http://uav.tridgell.net/XPlane/"
msgstr ""
"Bell JetRanger 直升机在 X-Plane 10/11 "
"中的完整参数集可在此处获取：http://uav.tridgell.net/XPlane/"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:255 e9d87d74ff334690812a1a95b2cb4210
msgid ""
"You also need to start SITL with the model set to \"xplane-heli\" instead of"
" \"xplane\" to activate Helicopter controls."
msgstr "您还需要在启动 SITL 时将型号设置为 「xplane-heli」 而非 「xplane」，以激活直升机控制模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:258 760eb249cc134fc393b5977862e645b7
msgid "The startup procedure for a helicopter is:"
msgstr "直升机的启动流程如下："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:260 9c60b7a249da40bb9d5129ba5e6c2d98
msgid "set interlock on (so RC input channel 8 is low)"
msgstr "开启联锁（使遥控输入通道 8 为低电平）"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:261 68e7681b9ff246009eefdb2360761ab3
msgid "set zero collective (so RC input channel 3 is low)"
msgstr "将总距设为零（使遥控输入通道 3 为低电平）"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:262 6b1bc391afac4924866744497c7372a9
msgid "arm the helicopter"
msgstr "解锁直升机"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:263 29f3377c366c49aaa55df927cb558af0
msgid "set interlock off (so RC input channel 8 is high)"
msgstr "关闭联锁（使遥控输入通道 8 为高电平）"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:264 75d300846eaf45c2a621ebfca6f3d2ec
msgid "wait for the head to reach full speed"
msgstr "等待旋翼头达到全速"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-xplane.rst:265 7c5c4c18e73649d78af23122cae2d80d
msgid "takeoff"
msgstr "起飞"
